  "body": "Mimalloc is unconditionally linked with ART and it causes ART to crash due to [this bug](https://github.com/microsoft/mimalloc/issues/1007).\n\nPlease consider to re-enable the ```ENABLE_MIMALLOC``` cmake option, which is currently commented out.\n\nJemalloc is a default allocator on FreeBSD. It isn't clear whether mimalloc is actually better than jemalloc, so users should be allowed to choose whether to use it or not.\n\n\nThank you.\n\nVersion: 1.25.2\nFreeBSD 14.2",
